flowchart TD
    box_0(["Start"])
    box_1["Record the batch number, marking darkness level, and<br/>number of affected parts. Collect three<br/>representative samples for quality assurance team<br/>reference."]
    box_2{"Is the input material surface finish within<br/>specification (no unusual reflectivity or coating<br/>variation)?"}
    box_3["Complete the following checks: 1. Verify that parts<br/>are from the correct material batch. 2. Check the<br/>surface finish specification for the current product<br/>type."]
    box_4["Reject the current batch and reload parts from a<br/>confirmed correct material batch. Create a non<br/>conformance record."]
    box_5{"Is the laser power level at the correct setpoint for<br/>this product type?"}
    box_6["Check the laser power reading on the marking<br/>controller against the product specification. Verify<br/>that no power ramp up or drift has occurred since<br/>the last calibration."]
    box_7["Reduce the laser power level to the specified<br/>setpoint and rerun a test mark. Verify the marking<br/>darkness against the reference sample."]
    box_8{"Is the marking speed within specification for this<br/>product type?"}
    box_9["Complete the following checks: 1. Read the marking<br/>speed from the active programme parameter screen. 2.<br/>Compare against the minimum and maximum speed range<br/>on the validated process sheet. 3. Check whether the<br/>speed setting was modified since the last good run."]
    box_10["Increase the marking speed to the specified value to<br/>reduce energy deposition per unit area. rerun a test<br/>mark and compare with the reference sample."]
    box_11{"Is the laser focal distance correct for the current<br/>part height?"}
    box_12["Complete the following checks: 1. Measure the<br/>distance from the marking head reference face to the<br/>part surface. 2. Compare against the focal distance<br/>specified on the laser system datasheet. 3. Check<br/>the focal distance adjustment mechanism for play or<br/>slippage."]
    box_13["Adjust the marking head height to achieve the<br/>specified focal distance. rerun a test mark and<br/>verify darkness level."]
    box_14{"Is the fume extraction unit clean and operating at<br/>the correct airflow rate?"}
    box_15["Complete the following checks: 1. Inspect the fume<br/>extraction filter cartridge for colour and loading.<br/>2. Measure air velocity at the extraction inlet with<br/>an anemometer. 3. Compare volumetric flow rate<br/>against the minimum specification."]
    box_16["Clean or replace the fume extraction filter and<br/>verify airflow returns to specification. Excessive<br/>fume build up can cause secondary marking darkening."]
    box_17{"Is the marking darkness within specification after<br/>all corrections?"}
    box_18["Escalate to the maintenance team: marking darkness<br/>cannot be corrected through operating adjustments;<br/>inspect laser optics and galvo mirror calibration."]
    box_19["Create a non conformance record for the affected<br/>batch and record all corrective actions in the<br/>quality log."]
    box_20(["End, notify quality assurance team."])
    box_21{"Is the marking defect rate high enough across the<br/>current batch to indicate a systematic process<br/>failure requiring immediate production halt?"}
    box_22(["End, production halted immediately: batch marking<br/>failure critical, quarantine current batch and<br/>escalate to process engineer for root cause<br/>investigation"])

    box_1 --> box_3
